---
import PlainPage from '../layouts/PlainPage.astro';
---
<PlainPage title="Refund Policy" description="How Belgium420 handles damaged, wrong, or refused orders.">
  <h1>Refund <span>Policy</span></h1>
  <p class="lead">This is a plain shop policy so the footer link goes somewhere. It is not a lawyer-drafted warranty.</p>
  <h2>Before an order ships</h2>
  <p>Email us if you need to cancel before payment clears or before the package is dropped off. We will confirm by email.</p>
  <h2>Damaged or wrong items</h2>
  <p>If a package arrives damaged or the contents do not match the order, email <a href="mailto:mstwntdpacks@gmail.com">mstwntdpacks@gmail.com</a> within 7 days with your order id and photos of the package and the items. We will replace the affected items or refund the merchandise for those items.</p>
  <h2>Change of mind</h2>
  <p>Opened consumable goods are not returnable after delivery. Shipping fees are refunded only when the mistake is ours or the carrier returns a package we cannot deliver.</p>
  <h2>Address problems</h2>
  <p>Orders refused, returned, or lost because the address was wrong are not automatically refunded. Contact us and we will look at the tracking.</p>
</PlainPage>
